# Build output, runtime data, local secrets and editor cruft.
#
# One rule worth keeping in mind: anchor a pattern — a leading "/" or a real
# path — whenever the name could also be a source directory. This repo carries
# three source trees, and `data`, `build`, `dist` and `out` are all ordinary
# package or directory names inside them. An unanchored `data/` once swallowed
# the Android data package (Prefs.kt) silently. `make check-ignore` guards it.

# IDE / editors
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
.*.sw?
*~

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Secrets / local env
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.jks
*.keystore
keystore.properties
# Claude Code keeps per-checkout overrides here; a project settings.json is shared
.claude/settings.local.json

# Runtime data and uploads, anchored to the repo root — NOT the Android `data/`
# source package. /data/ is the compose volume; the image directories appear
# when the binary runs outside Docker, since IMAGES_DIR defaults to a sibling of
# the database (`./images` for the default `./notes.db`).
/data/
/images/
backend/images/

# SQLite files. Real deployments keep the database in /var/lib/greynote or a
# Docker volume; one appearing in the tree is a stray run (the binary's default
# SQLITE_PATH is ./notes.db).
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# Local scratch from manual API pokes
cookie.txt
cookies.txt
*.log

# Backend: binary, test binaries and coverage profiles. Profiles are listed by
# name rather than globbed as *.out, so a golden-file fixture is never ignored.
backend/greynote
backend/*.exe
*.test
coverage.out
cover.out
*.cover

# Web client
frontend/dist/
frontend/coverage/

# Desktop client (bundle.js is generated by scripts/build-desktop.sh)
electron/dist/
electron/out/
electron/coverage/
electron/renderer/bundle.js
electron/renderer/bundle.js.map
electron/test/screenshots/

# Node dependencies, wherever they appear
node_modules/

# Android build
android/.gradle/
android/.kotlin/
android/build/
android/app/build/
android/app/.cxx/
android/app/release/
android/captures/
android/local.properties

# Gradle wrapper: this checkout tracks only gradle-wrapper.properties. There is
# no wrapper jar or script here — scripts/common.sh finds a cached distribution.
android/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar
android/gradlew
android/gradlew.bat

# Release artifacts (make dist)
/dist/
